{"id": "De4XVvXPTWY", "title": "Video by nick_saraev", "description": "Comment \"SOUND\" to get these 3 Free AI tools ro Add pro sound effects to your Claude edits.\n\nClaude has gotten really good at motion graphics and video editing.\n\nBut the sound effects it adds are still terrible.\n\nIt's like a great movie with the audio turned off.\n\nYou can fix that with three free tools.\n\nThey add professional sounds to your timeline at the right place and the right level.\n\nJust like a pro editor would.\n\nFirst is Openverse API.\n\nIt gives your AI agent access to over 5 million sound effects.\n\nIt can search and download them on its own.\n\nNo more digging through sound sites by hand.\n\nSecond is Real SFX.\n\nIt studies your timeline and finds every moment that needs a sound.\n\nThen it adds one at the exact frame.\n\nAnd third is earshot.\n\nIf your agent still can't find the right sound, earshot generates a brand new one in code.\n\nIt can even build a whole sound kit that fits your project.\n\nSo the agent never runs out of options.\n\nThree tools, and your edits finally sound as good as they look.\n\n#aiediting #videoeditng #claudecode #sfx #soundeffects", "channel": "nick_saraev", "uploader_id": "72269881052", "uploader": "Nick Saraev", "timestamp": 1792852812, "like_count": 5488, "comment_count": 7636, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-2267110013835651a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 65.55, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.famd5-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQP3rOSPny291933MZ6lxJ5EsvkXGZD6P6sbDSFnjAyS5CL4buUvDyySh6GazsPQ90JKJzhuy_lLVS0wJVs2U1r9OPIn0DPN-KgBcYU.mp4?_nc_cat=105&_nc_oc=Adr-SCyXQs82ATI4q1z8vTiq_pebL75b-sTslOBgFjI8258arKog9gPSZ9NXlrHxkz4&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.famd5-3.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=EibYGdH7NiwQ7kNvwGyXBa8&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=c97O0ECX8dndPNwEKmYeew&_nc_ss=70a8c&_nc_map=urlgen_bucket